msgstr ""

#: settings.c:1460
msgid "Choose a shader preset file."
msgstr ""

#: settings.c:1542
msgid "Put every setting in this window back to its default?\n\nYour controls, ROM folder and cheats are kept."
msgstr ""

#: settings.c:1544
msgid "Put every setting on this tab back to its default?\n\nThe other tabs are left as they are."
msgstr ""

#: settings.c:1546
msgid "Restore Tab Defaults"
msgstr ""

#: settings.c:1678
msgid "SETTINGS WINDOW"
msgstr ""

#: settings.c:1679
msgid "  Where it is:"
msgstr ""

#: settings.c:1680
msgid "   Options > Settings... or the Settings button on the toolbar: the options of the menus, and some more, on tabs. Hover over an option for the same description. Changes show at once while the window is open, so you can see their effect; OK keeps them and Cancel (also the X and Esc) puts every setting back as it was. Alt and the underlined letter of a tab (shown once Alt is pressed) opens it. Restore Defaults (bottom left) puts the settings of this tab, or of all tabs, back to their defaults, keeping your controls, ROM folder and cheats."
msgstr ""

